OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of Aberdeen's Raac
OL,4,Aproperties gets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition of homes in Aberdeen
OL,7,Faffected by potentially dangerous Raac
OL,8,Fis now under way.
OL,10,FMore than 500 properties - most of them
OL,11,Fcouncil-owned - were found to contain
OL,12,Freinforced autoclaved aerated concrete
OL,13,Fin 2023.
OL,15,FSigns warning of demolition in progress
OL,16,Fhave been put on fencing that has been
OL,17,Ferected around properties, some of
OL,18,Fwhich have already been knocked down.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
