OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of Aberdeen's Raac
OL,4,Aproperties gets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the work began on
OL,7,FMonday, and residents told BBC Scotland
OL,8,FNews it was "upsetting" to see homes
OL,9,Ffinally starting to disappear.
